 end="2:24.614">ца</span> <span begin="2:25.266" end="2:25.372">гром</span> <span begin="2:25.634" end="2:25.716">гре</span><span begin="2:25.980" end="2:26.106">мел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雷声不绝，轰鸣震天</span></p><p begin="2:29.676" end="2:32.182" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.676" end="2:29.812">Без</span> <span begin="2:30.030" end="2:30.156">кон</span><span begin="2:30.374" end="2:30.592">ца</span> <span begin="2:31.214" end="2:31.364">гром</span> <span begin="2:31.582" end="2:31.762">гре</span><span begin="2:31.956" end="2:32.182">мел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雷声不绝，轰鸣震天</span></p><p begin="2:34.128" end="2:38.412" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.128" end="2:34.232">И</span> <span begin="2:34.357" end="2:34.472">ве</span><span begin="2:34.651" end="2:34.762">тер</span> <span begin="2:34.902" end="2:35.027">выл,</span> <span begin="2:35.608" end="2:35.737">и</span> <span begin="2:35.862" end="2:35.997">ве</span><span begin="2:36.122" end="2:36.237">тер</span> <span begin="2:36.357" end="2:36.502">выл,</span> <span begin="2:37.102" end="2:37.162">в де</span> <span begin="2:37.312" end="2:37.397">брях</span> <span begin="2:37.548" end="2:37.612">он</span> <span begin="2:37.808" end="2:37.922">бу</span><span begin="2:38.042" end="2:38.137">ше</span><span begin="2:38.248" end="2:38.412">вал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风在山岭间肆虐咆哮</span></p><p begin="3:30.631" end="3:36.403" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.631" end="3:31.001">Где,</span> <span begin="3:31.001" end="3:31.311">ко</span><span begin="3:31.311" end="3:31.576">гда,</span> <span begin="3:31.576" end="3:31.836">ска</span><span begin="3:31.836" end="3:31.961">жи,</span> <span begin="3:32.147" end="3:32.257">за</span><span begin="3:32.504" end="3:32.860">во</span><span begin="3:32.860" end="3:33.084">ё</span><span begin="3:33.084" end="3:33.334">ва</span><span begin="3:33.334" end="3:33.424">но</span> <span begin="3:33.600" end="3:33.968">бы</span><span begin="3:33.968" end="3:34.288">ло</span> <span begin="3:34.288" end="3:34.537">пра</span><span begin="3:34.537" end="3:34.797">во</span> <span begin="3:34.797" end="3:34.943">на</span><span begin="3:35.107" end="3:35.223">род</span><span begin="3:35.452" end="3:35.563">ной</span> <span begin="3:35.803" end="3:36.012">воль</span><span begin="3:36.012" end="3:36.257">но</span><span begin="3:36.257" end="3:36.403">сти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你告诉我，何时何地</span></p><p begin="3:36.556" end="3:42.320" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.556" end="3:36.910">Без</span> <span begin="3:36.910" end="3:37.256">то</span><span begin="3:37.256" end="3:37.500">го,</span> <span begin="3:37.500" end="3:37.756">что</span><span begin="3:37.756" end="3:38.010">бы</span> <span begin="3:38.010" end="3:38.350">жиз</span><span begin="3:38.350" end="3:38.730">ни</span> <span begin="3:38.730" end="3:38.960">от</span><span begin="3:38.960" end="3:39.230">да</span><span begin="3:39.230" end="3:39.440">но</span> <span begin="3:39.440" end="3:39.850">в жерт</span> <span begin="3:39.850" end="3:40.245">ву</span> <span begin="3:40.245" end="3:40.445">не</span> <span begin="3:40.445" end="3:40.676">бы</span><span begin="3:40.676" end="3:40.920">ло,</span> <span begin="3:40.920" end="3:41.685">ска</span><span begin="3:41.685" end="3:42.320">жи?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们赢得自由的抗争可以不用牺牲来换取？</span></p><p begin="3:42.413" end="3:48.195" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.413" end="3:42.782">Где,</span> <span begin="3:42.782" end="3:43.167">ко</span><span begin="3:43.167" end="3:43.393">гда,</span> <span begin="3:43.393" end="3:43.622">ска</span><span begin="3:43.622" end="3:43.777">жи,</span> <span begin="3:43.902" end="3:44.313">за</span><span begin="3:44.313" end="3:44.642">во</span><span begin="3:44.642" end="3:44.873">ё</span><span begin="3:44.873" end="3:45.142">ва</span><span begin="3:45.142" end="3:45.289">но</span> <span begin="3:45.418" end="3:45.774">бы</span><span begin="3:45.774" end="3:46.138">ло</span> <span begin="3:46.138" end="3:46.354">пра</span><span begin="3:46.354" end="3:46.609">во</span> <span begin="3:46.609" end="3:46.774">на</span><span begin="3:46.854" end="3:47.043">род</span><span begin="3:47.278" end="3:47.394">ной</span> <span begin="3:47.594" end="3:47.834">воль</span><span begin="3:47.834" end="3:48.063">но</span><span begin="3:48.063" end="3:48.195">сти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你告诉我，何时何地</span></p><p begin="3:48.407" end="3:52.649" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:48.407" end="3:48.698">Без</span> <span begin="3:48.698" end="3:49.098">то</span><span begin="3:49.098" end="3:49.304">го,</span> <span begin="3:49.304" end="3:49.558">что</span><span begin="3:49.558" end="3:49.758">бы</span> <span begin="3:49.813" end="3:50.167">жиз</span><span begin="3:50.167" end="3:50.562">ни</span> <span begin="3:50.562" end="3:50.782">от</span><span begin="3:50.782" end="3:51.033">да</span><span begin="3:51.033" end="3:51.202">но</span> <span begin="3:51.333" end="3:51.518">в жерт</span> <span begin="3:51.673" end="3:52.013">ву</span> <span begin="3:52.013" end="3:52.258">не</span> <span begin="3:52.258" end="3:52.529">бы</span><span begin="3:52.529" end="3:52.649">ло?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们赢得自由的抗争可以不用牺牲来换取？</span></p><p begin="3:52.833" end="3:58.093" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:52.833" end="3:52.993">Кто</span> <span begin="3:53.168" end="3:53.324">вос</span><span begin="3:53.473" end="3:53.713">ста</span><span begin="3:53.713" end="3:53.958">ёт</span> <span begin="3:53.958" end="3:54.244">пер</span><span begin="3:54.368" end="3:54.773">вым</span> <span begin="3:54.773" end="3:54.968">к борь</span> <span begin="3:54.968" end="3:55.099">бе,</span> <span begin="3:55.213" end="3:55.418">то</span><span begin="3:55.598" end="3:55.778">му</span> <span begin="3:55.948" end="3:56.178">рань</span><span begin="3:56.178" end="3:56.428">ше</span> <span begin="3:56.428" end="3:56.789">всех</span> <span begin="3:56.789" end="3:57.052">жерт</span><span begin="3:57.133" end="3:57.384">во</span><span begin="3:57.384" end="3:57.628">ю</span> <span begin="3:57.628" end="3:58.093">пасть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁先奋身反抗，谁就注定先倒下牺牲</span></p><p begin="4:00.103" end="4:07.718" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:00.103" end="4:00.403">Э</span><span begin="4:00.929" end="4:01.139">то</span> <span begin="4:01.648" end="4:01.843">о</span><span begin="4:01.843" end="4:02.074">со</span><span begin="4:02.074" end="4:02.358">зна</span><span begin="4:02.358" end="4:02.574">вал</span> <span begin="4:02.574" end="4:02.818">все</span><span begin="4:02.818" end="4:02.998">гда</span> <span begin="4:04.708" end="4:07.718">я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早已知晓——我早已知晓</span></p></div></body></tt>